	<div class="fsElement fsContent footer-content" id="fsEl_2735" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p>Pflugerville ISD serves families across Pflugerville, Texas, with safe, supportive campuses and innovative learning opportunities for pre-K through 12th grade. Our commitment to excellence prepares every student for college, careers, and life, building the next generation of Pfuture-ready leaders in Central Texas.</p>

<hr />
<p style="font-size:13px; line-height:105%">Questions or information requests regarding the district or this website can&nbsp;be directed&nbsp;to <a href="mailto:communications@pfisd.net" target="_blank">communications@pfisd.net</a>. Pflugerville&nbsp;ISD&#39;s designated agent for the Digital Millennium Copyright Act is Chief Operations Officer, Victor Valdez, Pflugerville ISD Technology Department, <a href="mailto:digitalcopyright@pfisd.net" target="_blank">digitalcopyright@pfisd.net</a>. To provide notice of alleged copyright infringement, please notify Mr. Valdez at the address/email specified above. Please know that PfISD has policies and procedures related to copyright laws, available here:&nbsp;<a href="https://pol.tasb.org/PolicyOnline/PolicyDetails?key=1147&amp;code=CY#legalTabContent" target="_blank">https://pol.tasb.org/Policy/Code/1147?filter=CY</a>.</p>

<p style="font-size:13px; line-height:105%"><a href="https://www.pfisd.net/fs/admin" target="_blank">Admin Login</a></p>


	</div>


	</div>
	


	</div>


	</div>
	
